    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world, where pumpkins come to life...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the level to help this little pumpkin reach the top and find it's way home to the witch-house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With power-up's and loads of collectibles, this arcade platformer promises a cozy and worthwhile experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish achievements and collect candy to unlock some new cosmetics and content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play and get better at the game, the difficulty will gradually increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare yourself for a good time in this exciting upwards-platformer game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun at bug-hunting!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world, where pumpkins come to life...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the level to help this little pumpkin reach the top and find it's way home to the witch-house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With power-up's and loads of collectibles, this arcade platformer promises a cozy and worthwhile experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish achievements and collect candy to unlock some new cosmetics and content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play and get better at the game, the difficulty will gradually increase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prepare yourself for a good time in this exciting upwards-platformer game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun at bug-hunting!</p>",
    "short_description": "Help the pumpkin jump from platform to platform and collect candy. Give your pumpkin a unique look by unlocking new hats that you can get with the candy you have collected. This game is a fun challenge for young and old.",
